<title>HONG KONG: China Strategic 1996 net down 5.4 pct.</title>
<headline>China Strategic 1996 net down 5.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   36.81	 vs  43.13</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  227.76 gain vs  243.80 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    239.05	vs  252.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,770.11    vs  3,977.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Strategic Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 18-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 3</p>
<p>NOTE - China Strategic is an investment holding company with restaurant and property subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on disposal/dilution of interest in certain People's Republic of China subsidiaries, disposal/dilution of interest in associated companies and disposal of investment properties in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents vs 50 cents (including special interim dividend and special dividend).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
